{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00941",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 23.55,
      "duration_seconds": 22.33,
      "text": "Oh, I'm so sorry I'm late, doctor, the bus broke down by the chemist and then the driver let us all off, and I had to walk past my sister's house, she's just had a new kitchen, you should see it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.7,
      "end_seconds": 31.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Not to worry. Come and sit down. What's brought you in today? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.29,
      "end_seconds": 41.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "My heart. It races. Palpitations, the pharmacist called it. It happens after I've had too much coffee."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.87,
      "end_seconds": 49.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Tell me about it. What does it feel like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.09,
      "end_seconds": 60.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.61,
      "text": "Like a little bird in my chest, thumping and fluttering. It goes on for a few minutes, then it settles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.26,
      "end_seconds": 66.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "How much coffee are we talking about? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.62,
      "end_seconds": 84.35,
      "duration_seconds": 16.73,
      "text": "Five or six cups, on busy days. I'm a big believer in a good flat white. And an energy drink in the afternoon, if I'm honest. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.92,
      "end_seconds": 94.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "That's a lot of caffeine. Do you feel anything else when it happens?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.59,
      "end_seconds": 101.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "My hands go jittery. I can't hold a pen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.06,
      "end_seconds": 107.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.63,
      "end_seconds": 111.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "No chest pain. Never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.2,
      "end_seconds": 117.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "When did you last have an episode? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.96,
      "end_seconds": 127.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Tuesday, at work. I'd had four coffees before ten. My colleague said I'd gone pale. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.63,
      "end_seconds": 135.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "And what do you do when it happens? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.27,
      "end_seconds": 152.7,
      "duration_seconds": 14.43,
      "text": "I sit down and drink water. And then I wonder if I'm dying. My mum gets the same, you know, she's a worrier. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.11,
      "end_seconds": 168.53,
      "duration_seconds": 14.42,
      "text": "I understand. Let me explain what I think is happening. Caffeine is a stimulant, it makes the heart beat faster and more forcefully. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.36,
      "end_seconds": 174.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "So it's the coffee? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.1,
      "end_seconds": 192.47,
      "duration_seconds": 15.37,
      "text": "Most likely, yes. The pattern fits, it comes after the coffee, settles in minutes, and you feel shaky as well. I think caffeine is the most likely trigger."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.74,
      "end_seconds": 200.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Do I have to give it up completely? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.65,
      "end_seconds": 217.24,
      "duration_seconds": 14.59,
      "text": "Not completely. Cut it to two cups a day, and drop the energy drinks. Do it gradually over a week, so you don't get a headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.24,
      "end_seconds": 224.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "That's going to be a tough week. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.69,
      "end_seconds": 235.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "I'd also like to give you propranolol, 10 mg, to take when it happens, up to twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.26,
      "end_seconds": 240.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Is it addictive? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.56,
      "end_seconds": 253.29,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "No, not at all. It calms the heart down. Don't take it if you're wheezy or have asthma. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.6,
      "end_seconds": 257.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "No asthma here. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.95,
      "end_seconds": 268.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Good. Keep a note of when the episodes happen and what you've had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.56,
      "end_seconds": 275.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I'll do a diary. I love a diary. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.74,
      "end_seconds": 284.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "If they carry on after two weeks of cutting down the coffee, come back and see me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.29,
      "end_seconds": 298.59,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "I will. Thank you so much, doctor, you've been so kind. And do try the new kitchen place, my sister's... ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.06,
      "end_seconds": 303.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Take care. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.41,
      "end_seconds": 306.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Cheerio. ~"
    }
  ]
}
